d full-suite evidence\n133|(incl. race/fuzz/tracecheck/cataloggen) is reused: the rev2 delta\n134|touches zero production bytes (all 10 production files\n135|byte-identical to the rev1 CR tree, verified against the rev1\n136|patch), and CR construction reruns the full configured suite\n137|itself. Rev1 detail kept below for the unchanged scope.\n138|\n139|## Validation reran (rev1 run, unchanged scope)\n140|\n141|All 30 configured commands from `task-board.config.json`\n142|(`spawn.worktree_isolation.validation.commands`), exits observed\n143|firsthand (logs `cmds/cmd01.log` … `cmds/cmd30.log`; race gate as\n144|`race/race-A…I.log` + `pkg/pkg-clonefidelity-race.log`; every log\n145|carries its command line + output + exit):\n146|\n147|- 1 gofmt check: 0. 2 build: 0. 3 vet: 0.\n148|- 4 `go test ./... -count=1 -v`: 0 — 45 packages `ok`, 2862\n149|  top-level PASS (+35 new), zero FAIL.\n150|- 5 race gate: 0 in 9 bounded groups (45/45 `ok`, zero `DATA\n151|  RACE`; sessquery alone 550.1 s), each with `-timeout 25m`.\n152|- 6 cover gate: 0 — 45 `ok`; `clonefidelity` 97.1%,\n153|  `clonebundle` 86.7%, `environ` 92.4% of statements.\n154|- 7–23 fuzz gates (rpcwire ×4, scalar ×1, canonicaljson ×4,\n155|  secconftest ×8, each `-fuzztime=100x -parallel=1`): all 0.\n156|- 24 tracecheck: 0 (`acceptance_cases=155`,\n157|  `clauses_discharged=70/574` — registry untouched).\n158|  25 cataloggen `-check`: 0.\n159|- 26 linux build: 0. 27 windows build: 0. 28 JSON sweep: 0.\n160|- 29 `task-board validate`: 0. 30 `git diff --check`: 0.\n161|- Brief extras: `GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go vet ./...`: 0\n162|  (`cmds/cmd-windows-vet.log`); importer set\n163|  (clonefidelity/clonebundle/environ/sessadapter/scalar): all `ok`\n164|  (`pkg/pkg-touched.log`); package logs `pkg-clonefidelity-v`\n165|  (333 PASS lines), `-cover` (97.1%), `-race` (`ok`, zero `DATA\n166|  RACE`).\n167|- Base vs candidate importer grid (matrix §C): moved classes none;\n168|  `clonebundle`/`environ` suites green before and after the\n169|  additive exports.\n170|\n171|## Bounds (sibling scope, not waived)\n172|\n173|Cross-artifact row coverage and source-evidence resolution need the\n174|manifests as inputs (no entry takes them); `byte_counts` value\n175|reconciliation is the explicit stated bound (shape-validated\n176|only; witnessed by admission over identical rows; owner: spec\n177|clarification (agent-session-manager-spec) + the §13.14.1\n178|capture-manifest leaf); core-derived booleans admit any value\n179|except the pinned\n180|archive rule; archive-scope per-row target evidence admitted as\n181|shaped; `forbid_reasons` admits literal strings (I3);\n182|`required_dispositions` keys read as capture classes (I1);\n183|breakdown reconciliation reads as per-disposition cross-sums (I2);\n184|1M-row admission pinned at the factored gate plus entry\n185|reachability. No `ax` command, `doctor` result, or runtime\n186|capability is claimed anywhere. Full interpretation record + clause\n187|map: `internal/clonefidelity/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n188|\n189|## Handoff state\n190|\n191|Candidate UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree for the handoff\n192|snapshot (4 modified landed files + new `internal/clonefidelity/`;\n193|`git status` shows nothing else; scratch-index tree\n194|`7bade702b4bf260219b199c5c1f6d2355c9e0ea0` over base `0ca3e4c`).\n195|Checklist: all items verified true this run (byte bound disclosed\n196|per the stated-bound item; \"The DoD item on aggregates is\n197|satisfied by the decision above\") — checked. Attached (rev2\n198|updates): `TASK-260830-2ya5le_results.md` (this file),\n199|`TASK-260830-2ya5le_conformance-matrix.md`,\n200|`TASK-260830-2ya5le_producer-evidence.tar.gz` (real gzip, under\n201|1 MiB: rev2 package/windows-vet/harness logs + 63 per-plant logs\n202|+ `MANIFEST.sha256`; rev1 full-suite logs stay valid for the\n203|unchanged production scope).","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
